{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は沈金です！\nFM-FUJIで21時からです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n明日の15時に配信されます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は予告が上がってますが\n今回は初の収録です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので\n今までののぎ天でやってない\n事故覚悟の新展開もありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#1に引き続き中田がMCしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先に言いますが\n前回よりMC下手になってるかも...\nすみません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"配信されたら観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の個別5部で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子ちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くるくる後れ毛ポニーテールに\n別れ際の衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という中田と双子コーデなるものを\nやってくれたわけです！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クルージングの時だったかな？\n一緒にやろうよ～と琴子ちゃんにお願いしてたら覚えててくれたのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分、忘れてたのはここだけの話。ごめん\nまさかやってくれると思わなかったから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田がもし5部まで無かったら\n琴子ちゃんと部数が被ってなくて\nできなかったわけだし\n中田を5部制にしてくれたファンのみなさんに改めて感謝してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/14/6742021/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで未だにテンション高いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}